| Check: loads V3DRender 0.02 from this folder (replacing an older one),
| runs V3DCheck (buffers, no GPU work), then V3DJob (the GPU's first jobs).
| Both write to Results here.
Set V3DCheck$Dir <Obey$Dir>
RMEnsure V3DRender 0.02 RMLoad <Obey$Dir>.V3DRender
RMEnsure V3DRender 0.02 Error V3DRender 0.02 didn't load
Run <Obey$Dir>.V3DCheck
Run <Obey$Dir>.V3DJob -o <Obey$Dir>.Results
